# Cloudflare Pages and Netlify read this file from the site root.
#
# The two headers make the page cross-origin isolated, which lets the app
# use the fastest browser storage. Without them it still runs, on a slower
# storage path shown in Settings. See HOSTING.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
